["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Money Launderers Love $100 Bills seigniorage trade-based money laundering Vancouver model banknote paradox SAR (Suspicious Activity Report)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-oddlots-央行不愿废除百元美钞-那是一笔-2-5-万亿无息贷款/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">54:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>央行不願廢除百元美鈔：那是一筆 2.5 萬億無息貸款</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">現金使用越來越少，流通中的美元卻創新高。央行有動力繼續印 100 美元紙鈔：這筆錢實質是美國政府 2.5 萬億美元的無息貸款，代價是給全球洗錢者提供便利。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">洗錢</span><span class=\"tag\">反洗錢</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Are Rumors of an Imminent Russian Attack Warranted? | Yaroslav Trofimov Article 5 Suwalki Gap Minsk-1 / Minsk-2 Operation Spiderweb\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-hiddenforces-俄罗斯陷在乌克兰-仍有余力对北约开新战线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b4203c8f6331570-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">49:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Forces</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>俄羅斯陷在烏克蘭，仍有餘力對北約開新戰線</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">俄軍在烏克蘭沒有取勝，但消耗戰喂出了世界最尖端的無人機步兵戰經驗；嘉賓認為它完全有餘力對北約發動一次有限試探，窗口就在特朗普任期的最後階段。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄烏戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 399: Dan Dennett&#x27;s Model of Mind (Part Two) multiple drafts model heterophenomenology phi phenomenon qualia illusionism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-pel-意识不是剧场-dennett-说体验就是判断本身/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1e15495695462c4f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>意識不是劇場：Dennett 說體驗就是判斷本身</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dennett 的「多重草稿」模型否認大腦裡有個中央屏幕：沒有「先感覺、後判斷」兩步，體驗本身就是一堆並行判斷的蒸餾物。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心靈哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">意識</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Battle of New York Explained short war fallacy fortification creep Hessians Jamaica Pass\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-historyhit-纽约战役-豪将军三次放走华盛顿-美国才活了下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/67680fd5ac05eafe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:42:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>紐約戰役：豪將軍三次放走華盛頓，美國才活了下來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英軍的目標是消滅華盛頓的軍隊，不是佔領城市。豪將軍三次讓到手的獵物溜走，華盛頓則學會了一件事：只要軍隊還在，美國就還活著。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">獨立戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">軍事戰略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Why Your Preschooler Is Hitting, Biting, or Kicking (And What Helps) autonomy kindergarten readiness accommodation power-over model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-parentmojo-孩子打咬踢不是坏行为-是在夺回身体自主权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>孩子打咬踢不是壞行為，是在奪回身體自主權</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">別再問怎麼讓打人停止。三四歲孩子的打咬踢，常常是身體被成人幾乎掌控一切後，僅剩的喊出「我沒有發言權」的工具——給回一點選擇，行為才會減少。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">學齡前</span><span class=\"tag\">幼兒攻擊行為</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"703. Roman Civil War: Marching on the Senate (Part 3) pomerium popularis Cinnanum Tempus Hellespont\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-06-restishistory-罗马将军带兵打进首都-元老院却宣布他是合法执政/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>羅馬將軍帶兵打進首都，元老院卻宣布他是合法執政</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蘇拉帶六個軍團跨過神聖邊界攻入羅馬，把馬略定為公敵；他前腳東征，馬略後腳反攻倒算，第七次當選執政官後醉死。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬史</span><span class=\"tag\">政治極化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Flood that Wrecked the Hard Disk Drive Industry industrial estate slider La Niña cartelize\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-06-asianometry-泰国洪水重创硬盘业-最大的厂跌倒-老二捡了王座/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cdd681ba1ae2c3c7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">19:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>泰國洪水重創硬盤業：最大的廠跌倒，老二撿了王座</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">泰國一場洪水改寫了硬盤座次：最大廠 Western Digital 出貨環比跌51%，Seagate 只跌8%，反超登頂。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬盤</span><span class=\"tag\">泰國</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"393. Road To 9/11: Interviewing Bin Laden In The Caves of Tora Bora (Part 5) fatwa Alec Station B-roll PNG\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-06-empirehist-本-拉登1997年就宣战了-美国四年后才听懂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">47:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>本·拉登1997年就宣戰了，美國四年後才聽懂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1997年CNN拍下本·拉登首次電視宣戰，當時幾乎無人注意；真正讓美國醒過來的是1998年兩座使館被炸——他要的不是很多人看，是很多人死。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">反恐</span><span class=\"tag\">情報機構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1355: Four billion years of AI training data E-value healthy vaccinee bias genomic language model AS01 adjuvant compensation mutation phage cocktail\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-06-twiv-ai-设计出能感染细菌的病毒-但成功率仅-5/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:38:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>AI 設計出能感染細菌的病毒，但成功率僅 5%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 第一次從頭設計出能感染細菌的完整病毒基因組；實驗驗證成功率只有約 5%，遠沒有媒體說的那麼全能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI病毒設計</span><span class=\"tag\">噬菌體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"E198 《資本回報》思維、關注聰明錢 | 永慶對談戴斌 MA200 資本開支強度 配對研究 Act2\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-06-touzishizhan-资本周期框架错过英伟达-他复盘了自己算错的账/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/478f2b894977699e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">投資實戰派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>資本週期框架錯過英偉達：他復盤了自己算錯的賬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用資本回報框架看AI硬件，戴斌承認錯過了主線。他2023年按服務器滲透率給英偉達估出3萬多億美元市值，後來CAPEX從2000漲到9000，他沒跟蹤量級變化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">資本週期</span><span class=\"tag\">價值投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Nvidia Is Betting on Its Customers. Gen Z Is Betting on Sports. Will It All End the Same Way? zero DTE options SPV equity method mosaic effect\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-06-excessreturns-体育博彩渗透z世代-金融监管风险被低估/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">55:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>體育博彩滲透Z世代，金融監管風險被低估</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">體育博彩正成為Z世代財務策略的一部分，其緩慢損失比一次性大虧更難恢復，且與金融產品同處一平臺，未來監管風險被普遍低估。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">體育博彩</span><span class=\"tag\">Z世代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ion Drives: The Slow Rockets That Win Space ion drive specific impulse (ISP) delta V Hall thruster Oberth effect\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-06-isaacarthur-离子推进-慢慢推-反而赢下太空竞速/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cb30183de345fa0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">IsaacArthur</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>離子推進：慢慢推，反而贏下太空競速</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">火箭不一定越猛越好。離子引擎推力小到像一張紙，卻能連續工作數年，用極少的推進劑積累出化學火箭做不到的速度，成為太空物流的主力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">離子推進</span><span class=\"tag\">電推進</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why companies are becoming a series of loops | Anish Acharya (a16z) loop autocatalytic effects recursive self-improvement\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-06-lennys-公司变成一串自动循环-ai-能到坡顶-换山还得靠人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9071c4e5c21eb753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>公司變成一串自動循環：AI 能到坡頂，換山還得靠人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">公司正在被改造成一串互相咬合的循環；循環可以把當前業務推到局部最優，但在平臺期之後，選下一座山仍要靠人類直覺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 應用</span><span class=\"tag\">消費 AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Your AI Doctor Is Coming | Julie Yoo leapfrog dynamic AI native and AI proof N of one AI scribes third-party payer system\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-06-a16z-医疗没建过中间件-反而能直接跳到-ai-原生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>醫療沒建過中間件，反而能直接跳到 AI 原生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國醫療是科技投入佔收入比最低的行業，沒鋪過 SaaS 中間層，所以沒有沉沒成本要拆——這是它第一次出現醫生自發使用技術的有機採納潮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療AI</span><span class=\"tag\">數字健康</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: GWOT at 25 with Wesley Morgan ODA PRT MRAP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-05-chinatalk-美军哨所是危险气泡-反恐战争如何困住自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ee0ccdda91989e75-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>美軍哨所是危險氣泡：反恐戰爭如何困住自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美軍在阿富汗的哨所本為保護村莊，卻成了吸引衝突的靶子。越打越笨重，失去機動性，最終被自己建造的堡壘困住。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阿富汗戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">美軍</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Four Dead in Ohio | Kent State Shootings 2 | U.S. History ROTC National Guard\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-05-extracredits-肯特州立枪击-国民警卫队为何向学生开火/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/215a977ff5cc4751-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>肯特州立槍擊：國民警衛隊為何向學生開火</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1970年肯特州立大學，國民警衛隊向抗議學生開火，4人死亡。混亂的命令、過時的戰術和武裝對峙，讓一場和平抗議演變成流血事件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">肯特州立</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1104 - Sep 5 2026 ADS-CFT Calabi-Yau metasurface PEM tachyon\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-05-skeptics-弦理论没描述我们的宇宙-但它没死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:13:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>弦理論沒描述我們的宇宙，但它沒死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">弦理論家自己承認：弦理論沒有描述我們所在的宇宙，這一點毫無歧義。但它從萬物理論降級成了理論物理的工具箱——ADS-CFT 讓 10 維弦理論和 4 維量子場論攜帶相同信息，一邊難的問題在另一邊容易。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">弦理論</span><span class=\"tag\">深空推進</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Olympe de Gouges Citoyen\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-05-stuffmissed-她为女权呐喊-却被以叛国罪处死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">36:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>她為女權吶喊，卻被以叛國罪處死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Olympe de Gouges 以《女權宣言》聞名，但她的死並非因為女權主張，而是因為反對處決國王、抨擊羅伯斯庇爾。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">法國大革命</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jared Diamond on Whether Leaders Make History Hamlet test discretion natural experiment regression to the mean\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-05-goodfight-统一是致命劣势-中国反复错过工业革命-欧洲靠分裂跑赢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>統一是致命劣勢：中國反覆錯過工業革命，歐洲靠分裂跑贏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戴蒙德說，在萬年尺度上地理決定一切、個人什麼都不是；但尺度縮小到東西德和南北朝鮮，制度就是一切、地理幾乎什麼都不是。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">領導力</span><span class=\"tag\">制度經濟學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Aaron Levie on Why Open AI Wins open weights distillation model routing prompt injection sovereign cloud\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-05-a16z-开放权重不是零和-美国该自己下场做开源/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>開放權重不是零和：美國該自己下場做開源</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把開放權重當成閉源實驗室的威脅是把經濟學搞反了——它只是增加AI用例，而真正的錢在推理，不在模型本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開放權重</span><span class=\"tag\">模型路由</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Can We End Factory Farming Without Giving Up Meat? (with Bruce Friedrich) cultivated meat plant-based meat Wright&#x27;s law antimicrobial resistance mycoprotein cell immortalization\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-04-clearerthink-劝人少吃肉失败了-55-年-替代肉才是唯一出路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6c2f45dd923b89a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Clearer Thinking</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>勸人少吃肉失敗了 55 年，替代肉才是唯一齣路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全球人均吃肉量年年破紀錄，勸人吃素的路線已經失敗；唯一能改變軌跡的是讓植物肉和培養肉在價格和口味上追平真肉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">替代蛋白</span><span class=\"tag\">培養肉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"GPT-6 Hits AGI? Tech Euphoria 2.0, SF Mansion Shortage, NYC Bans AI in Schools &amp; Venezuela Oil Deal effective altruism (EA) p(doom) optionality\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-04-allin-agi-可能年初就已经在了-剩下的是怎么把它变成钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eea425a66973406-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>AGI 可能年初就已經在了，剩下的是怎麼把它變成錢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chamath 判斷 AGI 本質上從今年年初就已經存在，差別只在閉源實驗室用什麼節奏釋放，接下來三到四個月就會被追平。真正的瓶頸不是跑分，而是公司和普通人怎麼把它組織成有 ROI 的東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 泡沫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"From CEO to Startups: Masters in Business with Former Vanguard CEO Bill McNabb cash sweep hedgehog concept hyperscalers target date funds\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-04-mastersinbiz-指数基金赢在算术-不在牛市-vanguard-前-ceo-的复盘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>指數基金贏在算術，不在牛市：Vanguard 前 CEO 的復盤</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">指數跑贏九成主動基金靠的是算術而非行情——主動與被動加起來必須等於市場，再扣掉成本，優勢就是結構性的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">指數基金</span><span class=\"tag\">財富管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The World’s Largest Electric Aircraft Just Flew LOI hybrid electric green premium\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-04-ycsp-全球最大电动飞机首飞-电费仅5美元-挑战支线航空/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cde23fc82906a061-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">14:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>全球最大電動飛機首飛：電費僅5美元，挑戰支線航空</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Heart Aerospace 的 ES-30 電動飛機以 5 美元電費起飛，運營成本比舊機型低 48%，瞄準全球半數兩小時內的短途航班，用混合動力解決備用電池難題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">電動飛機</span><span class=\"tag\">清潔能源</span>\n</div></div></a>"]